Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.71,0:03:47.54,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,50)}{\be1}{\ko2}無{\ko2}論{\ko2}何{\ko2}時{\ko2}都{\ko2}不{\ko2}應{\ko2}迷{\ko2}茫
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.71,0:03:47.54,opcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)}{\k5}{\kf2}無{\kf2}論{\kf2}何{\kf2}時{\kf2}都{\kf2}不{\kf2}應{\kf2}迷{\kf2}茫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.55,0:03:50.30,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,50)}{\be1}{\ko2}因{\ko2}為{\ko2}有{\ko2}著{\ko2}無{\ko2}法{\ko2}磨{\ko2}滅{\ko2}的{\ko2}思{\ko2}念
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.55,0:03:50.30,opcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)}{\k5}{\kf2}因{\kf2}為{\kf2}有{\kf2}著{\kf2}無{\kf2}法{\kf2}磨{\kf2}滅{\kf2}的{\kf2}思{\kf2}念
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:54.43,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,50)}{\be1}{\ko2}直{\ko2}視{\ko2}那{\ko2}已{\ko2}經{\ko2}揭{\ko2}開{\ko2}的{\ko2}真{\ko2}相
